  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "修复单指滚动与双指缩放切换；改进 PPTX 层级、裁剪与版式继承，DOCX 分页和表格列宽，XLSX 图片锚点、对齐与异步切表；取消离屏任务并限制图片解码并发。Fix touch pan/pinch transitions; improve PPTX paint order, cropping and layout inheritance, DOCX breaks and table widths, and XLSX anchors, alignment and async sheet switching; cancel offscreen work and bound image decoding.",
